{"title":"蓝桥杯真题：最少砝码（贪心/数学推导）","slug":"2024-04-02-最少砝码","date":"2024-04-02T03:29:30.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.064Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-04-02-最少砝码.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"问题描述\"><a href=\"#问题描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题描述\"></a>问题描述</h2><p>你有一架天平。现在你要设计一套砝码，使得利用这些砝码可以称出任意小于等于 $N$ 的正整数重量。那么这套砝码最少需要包含多少个砝码？</p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong> 砝码可以放在天平两边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\"><a href=\"#输入格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入格式\"></a>输入格式</h2><p>输入包含一个正整数 $N$。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\"><a href=\"#输出格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出格式\"></a>输出格式</h2><p>输出一个整数代表答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样例输入\"><a href=\"#样例输入\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"样例输入\"></a>样例输入</h2><figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br><span class=\"line\">112</span><br><span class=\"line\">113</span><br><span class=\"line\">114</span><br><span class=\"line\">115</span><br><span class=\"line\">116</span><br><span class=\"line\">117</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例输出</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```text</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例说明</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">由 3 个砝码重量分别是 1、4、6，可以称出 1 至 7 的所有重量：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 称重重量 | 组合方式 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 1 | 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 2 | 6 - 4 (天平一边放6，另一边放4) |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 3 | 4 - 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 4 | 4 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 5 | 6 - 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 6 | 6 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 7 | 1 + 6 |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">可以证明，少于 3 个砝码不可能称出 1 至 7 的所有重量。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 评测用例规模与约定</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">对于所有评测用例，$1 \\le N \\le 1,000,000,000$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 解题思路：贪心与平衡三进制</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 1. 核心分析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">这是一道经典的**贪心算法**题目，其本质与**平衡三进制**（Ternary Numeral System）有关。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">题目要求砝码数量最少，且砝码可以放在天平两端。假设我们已经有一组砝码，它们能称出的最大连续重量为 $S$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">当我们新增一个砝码 $w$ 时，由于天平两边都可以放，新的称重范围会有以下三种情况：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1. 砝码全在一边：$w + [1, S]$ $\\rightarrow$ 范围 $[w+1, w+S]$</span><br><span class=\"line\">2. 砝码在另一边（做减法）：$w - [1, S]$ $\\rightarrow$ 范围 $[w-S, w-1]$</span><br><span class=\"line\">3. 不使用该砝码：$[1, S]$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">为了让新范围能够与旧范围 $[1, S]$ **无缝衔接**，并最大化称重上限，我们需要满足两个条件：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1. **无缝衔接**：减法范围的上限应紧接原范围的下限（或重叠），即 $(w - 1)$ 应该等于 $S$（或 $S+1$，为求连续性，取 $w - 1 = S \\implies w = S + 1$）。但这样会造成浪费。</span><br><span class=\"line\">   </span><br><span class=\"line\">   实际上，为了让范围 $[w-S, w-1]$ 与 $[1, S]$ 连接，我们至少需要 $w - S \\le S + 1$（即新范围的最小值不能比旧范围最大值大太多）。为了**最大化**新范围，我们取临界条件：</span><br><span class=\"line\">   $$ w - S = S + 1 $$</span><br><span class=\"line\">   解得：</span><br><span class=\"line\">   $$ w = 2S + 1 $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">2. **最大化上限**：选择好 $w$ 后，新的最大称重重量为 $w + S$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 2. 推导过程</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">设当前砝码组合能称出的最大连续重量为 $S$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **初始状态**：$S = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **第一枚砝码**：为了称重 1，只能选 $w_1 = 1$。此时能称重范围 $[1, 1]$，最大值 $S_1 = 1$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **第二枚砝码**：为了扩展范围，最优选择 $w_2 = 2S_1 + 1 = 3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 新范围：$[3-1, 3+1] = [2, 4]$ 与 $[1, 1]$ 合并为 $[1, 4]$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 此时 $S_2 = 1 + 3 = 4$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **第三枚砝码**：最优选择 $w_3 = 2S_2 + 1 = 9$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 新范围：$[9-4, 9+4] = [5, 13]$ 与 $[1, 4]$ 合并为 $[1, 13]$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 此时 $S_3 = 4 + 9 = 13$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">观察规律，我们可以发现最大称重重量 $S$ 与砝码数量 $k$ 的关系：</span><br><span class=\"line\">$$ S_k = \\frac&#123;3^k - 1&#125;&#123;2&#125; $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">或者通过迭代公式理解：</span><br><span class=\"line\">$$ S_&#123;new&#125; = S_&#123;old&#125; + w = S_&#123;old&#125; + (2S_&#123;old&#125; + 1) = 3S_&#123;old&#125; + 1 $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 3. 算法实现</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">我们需要找到最小的 $k$，使得 $S_k \\ge N$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">直接迭代计算即可：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1. 初始化最大重量 $S = 0$，砝码数量 $count = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2. 循环条件：当 $S &lt; N$ 时。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3. 每次迭代：$S \\leftarrow 3S + 1$，$count \\leftarrow count + 1$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">4. 输出 $count$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 代码实现</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### Python 代码</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"># 定义一个列表用于存储每一级能称出的最大重量（可选，用于调试或记录）</span><br><span class=\"line\"># li = [0] </span><br><span class=\"line\"># 实际上我们只需要记录当前最大值即可</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">current_max = 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">count = 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">N = int(input())</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">while current_max &lt; N:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    # 核心递推公式：当前级最大称重 = 上一级最大称重 * 3 + 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    # 这也对应了新添加的砝码重量为 2*current_max + 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    current_max = current_max * 3 + 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    count += 1</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">print(count)</span><br><span class=\"line\">### 复杂度分析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**：$O(\\log_3 N)$。由于 $N$ 最大为 $10^9$，而 $3^&#123;18&#125;$ 远大于 $10^9$，循环最多执行 19 次，效率极高。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**：$O(1)$，仅使用了几个变量存储状态。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 参考数据对照</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">根据上述公式，我们可以推算出不同砝码数量能覆盖的最大重量范围：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 砝码数量 | 砝码组合示例 | 最大称重 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 1 | &#123;1&#125; | 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 2 | &#123;1, 3&#125; | 4 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 3 | &#123;1, 3, 9&#125; | 13 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 4 | &#123;1, 3, 9, 27&#125; | 40 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| ... | ... | ... |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| k | $1, 3, \\dots, 3^&#123;k-1&#125;$ | $\\frac&#123;3^k-1&#125;&#123;2&#125;$ |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">原题中的样例 $N=7$，落入 $(4, 13]$ 区间，因此答案为 3。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"问题描述\"><a href=\"#问题描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题描述\"></a>问题描述</h2><p>你有一架天平。现在你要设计一套砝码，使得利用这些砝码可以称出任意小于等于 $N$ 的正整数重量。那么这套砝码最少需要包含多少个砝码？</p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong> 砝码可以放在天平两边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\"><a href=\"#输入格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入格式\"></a>输入格式</h2><p>输入包含一个正整数 $N$。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\"><a href=\"#输出格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出格式\"></a>输出格式</h2><p>输出一个整数代表答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样例输入\"><a href=\"#样例输入\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"样例输入\"></a>样例输入</h2><figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br><span class=\"line\">112</span><br><span class=\"line\">113</span><br><span class=\"line\">114</span><br><span class=\"line\">115</span><br><span class=\"line\">116</span><br><span class=\"line\">117</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例输出</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```text</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 样例说明</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">由 3 个砝码重量分别是 1、4、6，可以称出 1 至 7 的所有重量：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 称重重量 | 组合方式 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 1 | 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 2 | 6 - 4 (天平一边放6，另一边放4) |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 3 | 4 - 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 4 | 4 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 5 | 6 - 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 6 | 6 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 7 | 1 + 6 |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">可以证明，少于 3 个砝码不可能称出 1 至 7 的所有重量。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 评测用例规模与约定</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">对于所有评测用例，$1 \\le N \\le 1,000,000,000$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 解题思路：贪心与平衡三进制</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 1. 核心分析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">这是一道经典的**贪心算法**题目，其本质与**平衡三进制**（Ternary Numeral System）有关。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">题目要求砝码数量最少，且砝码可以放在天平两端。假设我们已经有一组砝码，它们能称出的最大连续重量为 $S$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">当我们新增一个砝码 $w$ 时，由于天平两边都可以放，新的称重范围会有以下三种情况：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1. 砝码全在一边：$w + [1, S]$ $\\rightarrow$ 范围 $[w+1, w+S]$</span><br><span class=\"line\">2. 砝码在另一边（做减法）：$w - [1, S]$ $\\rightarrow$ 范围 $[w-S, w-1]$</span><br><span class=\"line\">3. 不使用该砝码：$[1, S]$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">为了让新范围能够与旧范围 $[1, S]$ **无缝衔接**，并最大化称重上限，我们需要满足两个条件：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1. **无缝衔接**：减法范围的上限应紧接原范围的下限（或重叠），即 $(w - 1)$ 应该等于 $S$（或 $S+1$，为求连续性，取 $w - 1 = S \\implies w = S + 1$）。但这样会造成浪费。</span><br><span class=\"line\">   </span><br><span class=\"line\">   实际上，为了让范围 $[w-S, w-1]$ 与 $[1, S]$ 连接，我们至少需要 $w - S \\le S + 1$（即新范围的最小值不能比旧范围最大值大太多）。为了**最大化**新范围，我们取临界条件：</span><br><span class=\"line\">   $$ w - S = S + 1 $$</span><br><span class=\"line\">   解得：</span><br><span class=\"line\">   $$ w = 2S + 1 $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">2. **最大化上限**：选择好 $w$ 后，新的最大称重重量为 $w + S$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 2. 推导过程</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">设当前砝码组合能称出的最大连续重量为 $S$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **初始状态**：$S = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **第一枚砝码**：为了称重 1，只能选 $w_1 = 1$。此时能称重范围 $[1, 1]$，最大值 $S_1 = 1$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **第二枚砝码**：为了扩展范围，最优选择 $w_2 = 2S_1 + 1 = 3$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 新范围：$[3-1, 3+1] = [2, 4]$ 与 $[1, 1]$ 合并为 $[1, 4]$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 此时 $S_2 = 1 + 3 = 4$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **第三枚砝码**：最优选择 $w_3 = 2S_2 + 1 = 9$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 新范围：$[9-4, 9+4] = [5, 13]$ 与 $[1, 4]$ 合并为 $[1, 13]$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">  - 此时 $S_3 = 4 + 9 = 13$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">观察规律，我们可以发现最大称重重量 $S$ 与砝码数量 $k$ 的关系：</span><br><span class=\"line\">$$ S_k = \\frac&#123;3^k - 1&#125;&#123;2&#125; $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">或者通过迭代公式理解：</span><br><span class=\"line\">$$ S_&#123;new&#125; = S_&#123;old&#125; + w = S_&#123;old&#125; + (2S_&#123;old&#125; + 1) = 3S_&#123;old&#125; + 1 $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 3. 算法实现</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">我们需要找到最小的 $k$，使得 $S_k \\ge N$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">直接迭代计算即可：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1. 初始化最大重量 $S = 0$，砝码数量 $count = 0$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2. 循环条件：当 $S &lt; N$ 时。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3. 每次迭代：$S \\leftarrow 3S + 1$，$count \\leftarrow count + 1$。</span><br><span class=\"line\">4. 输出 $count$。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 代码实现</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### Python 代码</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"># 定义一个列表用于存储每一级能称出的最大重量（可选，用于调试或记录）</span><br><span class=\"line\"># li = [0] </span><br><span class=\"line\"># 实际上我们只需要记录当前最大值即可</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">current_max = 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">count = 0</span><br><span class=\"line\">N = int(input())</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">while current_max &lt; N:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    # 核心递推公式：当前级最大称重 = 上一级最大称重 * 3 + 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    # 这也对应了新添加的砝码重量为 2*current_max + 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    current_max = current_max * 3 + 1</span><br><span class=\"line\">    count += 1</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">print(count)</span><br><span class=\"line\">### 复杂度分析</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**：$O(\\log_3 N)$。由于 $N$ 最大为 $10^9$，而 $3^&#123;18&#125;$ 远大于 $10^9$，循环最多执行 19 次，效率极高。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**：$O(1)$，仅使用了几个变量存储状态。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 参考数据对照</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">根据上述公式，我们可以推算出不同砝码数量能覆盖的最大重量范围：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">| 砝码数量 | 砝码组合示例 | 最大称重 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| :--- | :--- | :--- |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 1 | &#123;1&#125; | 1 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 2 | &#123;1, 3&#125; | 4 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 3 | &#123;1, 3, 9&#125; | 13 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 4 | &#123;1, 3, 9, 27&#125; | 40 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| ... | ... | ... |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| k | $1, 3, \\dots, 3^&#123;k-1&#125;$ | $\\frac&#123;3^k-1&#125;&#123;2&#125;$ |</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">原题中的样例 $N=7$，落入 $(4, 13]$ 区间，因此答案为 3。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Algorithm","path":"api/categories/Algorithm.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"Algorithm","path":"api/tags/Algorithm.json"},{"name":"Greedy","path":"api/tags/Greedy.json"},{"name":"Math","path":"api/tags/Math.json"}]}